epub2m4b (0.1.6) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Add format-aware cover video codec selection (mjpeg, png, libwebp).
  * Fix FFmpeg concat-list path escaping for demuxer syntax.
  * Unify ConfigurationError hierarchy and improve credential filtering.
  * Make chunk audio validation failure a retryable error.
  * Add cross-filesystem promotion fallback for audio artifacts.
  * Skip redundant state re-saving on already-complete chunks during recovery.
  * Validate narration speed to reject non-finite float values.
  * Wire missing navigation button handlers in Job Details.
  * Expand chapter timing tolerance to 50ms for AAC packet boundaries.

 -- EPUB2M4B contributors <maintainers@epub2m4b.invalid>  Fri, 18 Sep 2026 15:05:00 -0400

