epub2m4b (0.1.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Initial release for Ubuntu 26.04 (resolute) on amd64.
  * Guided first-run onboarding: book folder, cache folder, bundled voice
    auditions, and optional OpenAI API key saved to the system keyring.
  * Mouse-driven Library, Jobs, and Settings screens usable at 80x24.
  * Cost-gated OpenAI narration with typed confirmation, pause/resume/cancel,
    durable caching, and chaptered M4B assembly with FFmpeg.
  * ElevenLabs support is present but marked UNTESTED live and is refused
    until live verification.

 -- EPUB2M4B contributors <maintainers@epub2m4b.invalid>  Thu, 17 Sep 2026 18:18:44 -0400
